From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ExposureMG <exposuremg@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:32:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/14] vulkan/wsi/win32: don't require DXGI/DirectComposition
 for HW drivers

Only drivers providing get_d3d12_command_queue (dozen) can use DXGI
swapchains; everything else presents through the CPU image path, which
only needs GDI. Don't fail wsi_device_init() for non-sw devices when the
DXGI factory or the DComp device can't be created (no WDDM display stack,
wine), just leave the DXGI path disabled.

Generated-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_win32.cpp | 18 ++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_win32.cpp b/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_win32.cpp
index 0622857..96aefff 100644
--- a/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_win32.cpp
+++ b/src/vulkan/wsi/wsi_common_win32.cpp
@@ -1110,18 +1110,16 @@ wsi_win32_init_wsi(struct wsi_device *wsi_device,
    wsi->wsi = wsi_device;
 
    if (!wsi_device->sw) {
+      /* DXGI swapchains are optional: without DXGI or DirectComposition
+       * (e.g. no WDDM display stack, or wine), non-sw devices fall back to
+       * the CPU image path, which only needs GDI.
+       */
       wsi->dxgi.factory = dxgi_get_factory(WSI_DEBUG & WSI_DEBUG_DXGI);
-      if (!wsi->dxgi.factory) {
-         vk_free(alloc, wsi);
-         result = VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED;
-         goto fail;
-      }
-      wsi->dxgi.dcomp = dcomp_get_device();
-      if (!wsi->dxgi.dcomp) {
+      if (wsi->dxgi.factory)
+         wsi->dxgi.dcomp = dcomp_get_device();
+      if (wsi->dxgi.factory && !wsi->dxgi.dcomp) {
          wsi->dxgi.factory->Release();
-         vk_free(alloc, wsi);
-         result = VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED;
-         goto fail;
+         wsi->dxgi.factory = NULL;
       }
    }
 
